<title>UK: Sachsen LB sets one bln mark bond due June 2002.</title>
<headline>Sachsen LB sets one bln mark bond due June 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Commerzbank and CDC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SACHSEN LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    28.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.795    PAY DATE   S13.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     LISTING    FFT	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6	   SELL CONC  19	  PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEEFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 86</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
